#: code:addons/hr_rfid_odoo_import/models/hr_employee.py:0
msgid ""
"This attendance was brought over from another system and cannot be "
"recalculated here.\n"
"\n"
"%(records)s attendance records of %(who)s are a copy of what the old system "
"recorded. They cannot be worked out again from the door events, and "
"recalculating them would break the link with the old system: the next "
"transfer would no longer recognise them and would bring them over a second "
"time.\n"
"\n"
"To refresh this data, run the transfer again. To recalculate the rest, "
"choose a period without these records, or leave these people out."
msgstr ""
"Esta asistencia se trajo de otro sistema y no se puede recalcular aquí.\n"
"\n"
"%(records)s registros de asistencia de %(who)s son una copia de lo que "
"registró el sistema anterior. No se pueden volver a calcular a partir de los "
"eventos de puerta, y recalcularlos rompería el vínculo con el sistema "
"anterior: la próxima transferencia ya no los reconocería y los traería una "
"segunda vez.\n"
"\n"
"Para actualizar estos datos, ejecute la transferencia de nuevo. Para "
"recalcular el resto, elija un periodo sin estos registros, o excluya a estas "
"personas."

